        355.7713623046875,
        549.6924438476562
      ],
      "text": "Purpose of contact screening and management",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        556.7039184570312,
        513.41455078125,
        570.055419921875
      ],
      "text": "The main purposes of contact screening and management are twofold - first, to identify",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        572.7003784179688,
        513.4373779296875,
        586.0518798828125
      ],
      "text": "contacts of all ages with undiagnosed TB disease among the contacts of an index case,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        588.6968994140625,
        513.4718627929688,
        602.0484008789062
      ],
      "text": "and second, to provide preventive therapy for contacts without TB disease who are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        604.6934204101562,
        513.4605712890625,
        618.044921875
      ],
      "text": "susceptible to developing disease following recent infection. For children in close contact",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        620.68994140625,
        224.98287963867188,
        634.0414428710938
      ],
      "text": "with a TB case, this includes:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
